elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软发布首款语音对语音模型 MAI Realtime 1，定价仅为竞品三分之一</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布GPT-6.2 Astra与Sol模型，API缓存输入成本降低60%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic Claude Mythos仅用3天完成AMD MI355X芯片底层适配</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">红杉资本与光速创投等机构拟在Anthropic IPO中追加数十亿美元投资</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">人工智能初创公司Anthropic PBC的早期核心风投股东正计划在公司即将进行的首次公开募股（IPO）中追加数十亿美元投资。此次参与加码的机构包括红杉资本（Sequoia Capital）、Iconiq、光速创投（Lightspeed Venture Partners）、Accel以及Altimeter资本管理公司。这些顶级风投机构通过真金白银的投入，展现了对Anthropic在AI大模型领域技术研发实力及企业级市场商业潜力的长期信心。作为全球大模型竞争中的关键玩家，Anthropic凭借其强劲的发展势头持续获得资本市场的高度认可。此次多方机构的联合增持，不仅巩固了现有股东的战略布局，也进一步凸显了资本市场对AI头部初创企业上市前景的坚定支持，预示着AI赛道在资本层面的博弈将持续升温。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软第二代自研AI加速器Maia 200正式量产，每瓦性能提升1.7倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3d95eb09ad758c32ba760bf4f26d7690.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软在Ignite 2026活动上宣布，第二代自研AI加速器Maia 200已正式投入规模化生产。该芯片采用台积电3纳米工艺制造，配备216GB HBM3e内存与272MB片上SRAM，支持FP4与FP8张量核心。在FP4精度下，单颗芯片算力超10 petaFLOPS，并支持通过以太网构建最多6144颗加速器的集群。性能方面，Maia 200在Microsoft Teams、Copilot等AI功能中的每瓦token处理量较现有GPU基础设施提升1.7倍。目前，该芯片已在美国、欧洲和澳大利亚的数据中心部署，服务于Microsoft Copilot等生产负载，后续将扩展至GitHub Copilot与Microsoft Foundry。微软计划在2027年将Azure Maia系统扩展至多吉瓦级部署，旨在通过自研</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软发布首款语音对语音模型 MAI Realtime 1，定价仅为竞品三分之一</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a115baaae6375aa5e09b715011b69c3c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在 11 月 17 日的 Ignite 2026 大会上，微软正式发布首款语音对语音模型 MAI Realtime 1。该模型专为企业场景设计，支持实时打断、快速确认及多人对话处理，并能调用推理引擎连接企业系统执行预订或客服任务。在 Big Bench Audio 基准测试中，MAI Realtime 1 准确率达 98.9%，每小时输入音频成本仅 1.35 美元，显著低于 GPT-Realtime-2 High（4.14 美元）与 Grok Voice 2.0（4.80 美元）。基础语音使用费为每音频分钟 0.01 美元，推理费用为每百万输入 token 1 美元、输出 5 美元。该模型兼容 OpenAI Realtime API，目前 Agoda、Reservations.ai 已接入试用。微软计划将其集成</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布GPT-6.2 Astra与Sol模型，API缓存输入成本降低60%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于11月17日正式发布GPT-6.2 Astra与GPT-6.2 Sol两款新模型。Astra定位专业深度任务，在文档处理、编程及科学研究基准测试中表现卓越；Sol则作为通用模型，侧重提升日常任务处理效率。在API定价方面，GPT-6.2 Astra的输入与输出Token价格较前代降低20%，缓存输入价格大幅削减60%，Sol则维持原有定价。目前，两款模型已向ChatGPT Work、Codex的Plus、Pro、Enterprise及Edu用户开放，开发者可通过API调用。安全性方面，GPT-6.2系列已达到OpenAI准备框架中网络安全“关键”级别及生物化学能力“高”级别，官方已同步强化后台安全限制，确保技术应用合规可控。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic Claude Mythos仅用3天完成AMD MI355X芯片底层适配</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/85eb6c6bbc382b1bfb36920bfc16cbce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic旗下Claude Mythos模型近日实现技术突破，仅用时3天即完成对AMD MI355X芯片近100%的底层内核代码编写，将传统适配周期从6至12个月大幅压缩至72小时。经测试，移植后的模型运行性能与英伟达CUDA优化方案的差距仅在8%至12%之间，已达商业化落地标准。此次适配大幅降低了跨芯片门槛，Anthropic已与AMD达成最高2吉瓦的算力供应合作。该进展主要覆盖推理预填充环节，在超大规模分布式训练的多卡协同领域，英伟达CUDA生态仍具技术领先优势。此举虽未彻底颠覆CUDA护城河，但显著推动了算力供应链向多元化与开放化演进。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
